  "page_text": [
    "Banking relationship\n0319 00\nUBS Europe SE\nJanuary 15, 2026\nClassification as retail client\nForm configurator\nBranch\nBucket 1\n0\n0\nEquity (including equity funds and exchange-traded funds)\nBonds (including bond funds and exchange-traded funds)\n0\n0\nLiquidity and money market products\nPrecious metals and commodities (including funds)\n0\nMulti-asset-class funds (including strategy funds)\nBucket 2\n0\n0\n0\nHedge Funds\nPrivate Markets\nReal Estate (including real estate funds)\nBucket 3\n0\n0\nStructured products (protection, optimization, participation)\nOther derivatives (leveraged structured products, ETDs, OTCs)\nDear Sir or Madam\nClient protection enjoys is of the highest importance at UBS. An important step in this direction is an appropriate classification of our clients.\nWithin the context of your existing banking relationship, you were until now classified as \"Professional Client\" for the following asset classes:\nThis classification takes into account the securities transactions you have conducted with us. In the last 12 months the number of your securities transactions has dropped.\nIn order to legitimize this new situation as well as the changes of the products in the capital markets, we will be classifying all your relationships with us as \"Retail Client\". This means that you will be enjoying the highest level of investor protection. Please keep in mind that certain products will no longer be deemed appropriate for you.\nShould you at any point choose to restore your \"Professional Client\" status for certain asset classes, please contact your client advisor.\n0101664870401001501202601028\n66487\nEN\nV0\n019\nAALP\n12.04.2024\nN1\n15.01.2026\nPage 1/2",
    "Banking relationship\n0319 00\nIf you have any questions we are always at your disposal.\nSincerely\nUBS Europe SE\nCA\nUBS Europe SE is a subsidiary of UBS AG\nCompany seat: Bockenheimer Landstraße 2 - 4, D-60306 Frankfurt am Main, Tel. 069 2179 0, District Court of Frankfurt am Main HRB 107046\nChairman of Supervisory Board: Prof. Dr. Reto Francioni\nManagement Board: Tobias Vogel (Chair), Dr. Denise Bauer-Weiler, Filippo Bianco, Pierre Chavenon, Miriam Godoy Suarez, Georgia Paphiti\n0101664870401001501202602025\n66487\nEN\nV0\n019\nAALP\n12.04.2024\nN1\n15.01.2026\nPage 2/2"
